<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main">

  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="wrap about-hero__inner">
      <%- include('partials/breadcrumb') %>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">About Tech Fluid Industries</p>
      <h1>Fluid power engineering, built on the shop floor in Ahmedabad since 2009.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        We design and manufacture hydraulic cylinders, power packs and lifting
        equipment for customers who can't afford a seal failure mid-shift —
        earthmoving fleets, press lines, and material handling operations across India.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="facility-banner reveal">
        <svg class="facility-banner__illus" viewBox="0 0 900 380" role="img" aria-label="Tech Fluid Industries manufacturing floor in Ahmedabad"><use href="#illus-facility"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline reveal">
        <div class="timeline__point">
          <span class="timeline__year">2009</span>
          <p>Tech Fluid Industries is founded in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, to manufacture precision hydraulic cylinders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__point">
          <span class="timeline__year">Today</span>
          <p>15+ years of engineering experience, three product lines, and pan-India dispatch from Kathwada GIDC.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">How We Work</p>
        <h2>Every order starts as a specification, not a catalog number.</h2>
        <p>We don't stock generic cylinders and hope they fit. We ask for your bore, stroke, working pressure and mounting requirement first, then build to match.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="capability-list reveal" style="--rd:.1s">
        <li>
          <span class="icon-wrap"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-blueprint"/></svg></span>
          <div><h3>Custom design &amp; drafting</h3><p style="color:var(--steel-light); font-size:0.92rem; margin:0;">Bore, stroke, port and mounting configured to your machine, not the other way around.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="icon-wrap"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-gauge"/></svg></span>
          <div><h3>In-house pressure testing</h3><p style="color:var(--steel-light); font-size:0.92rem; margin:0;">Every unit tested on our own rigs at 1.5&times; rated pressure before dispatch.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="icon-wrap"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-shield"/></svg></span>
          <div><h3>Material selection</h3><p style="color:var(--steel-light); font-size:0.92rem; margin:0;">Alloy and stainless steel matched to the corrosion and load profile of the job.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="icon-wrap"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-truck"/></svg></span>
          <div><h3>Pan-India dispatch</h3><p style="color:var(--steel-light); font-size:0.92rem; margin:0;">Logistics and technical support that reaches project sites, not just city hubs.</p></div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--navy section--tight">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px; text-align:center;">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light" style="justify-content:center;">Our Approach</p>
      <h2>Precision engineering, tested before it's trusted.</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted-on-dark); font-size:1.05rem; margin-top:16px;">
        A hydraulic failure on an excavator boom or a press line doesn't just cost
        money — it stops a job site. That's the standard every cylinder, power pack
        and jack we build is measured against, from first drawing to final test.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
